# Keep the build context small and never ship secrets or local data.
#
# A PATTERN WITHOUT `**/` ONLY MATCHES AT THE ROOT OF THE BUILD CONTEXT.
# That is Docker's rule, not an accident of this file, and this file used it
# inconsistently: `**/__pycache__/` was written correctly while `.env`, `*.db`
# and `.pytest_cache/` were not. Since the Dockerfile does `COPY backend/ ./`,
# everything under `backend/` was therefore in scope.
#
# Measured with a real build rather than argued (four files, one context):
#
#     .dockerignore: *.db, .env, .env.*, .pytest_cache/
#     ./.env                    excluded
#     ./sandbox.db              excluded
#     ./backend/.env            COPIED INTO THE IMAGE
#     ./backend/sandbox.db      COPIED INTO THE IMAGE
#     ./backend/.pytest_cache/  COPIED INTO THE IMAGE
#
# And it was not hypothetical: `/app/.pytest_cache` is present in the shipped
# image today, from `backend/.pytest_cache`, with `.pytest_cache/` sitting in
# this file the whole time. A `backend/.env` would have shipped the same way.
#
# So: anything that can exist in a subdirectory is `**/`-prefixed below. The
# few patterns that are deliberately root-only keep a leading `/` or an
# explicit path, and say so.

# --- version control / CI ---
.git/
.github/
.gitattributes

# --- python ---
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/.venv/
**/venv/
# Scratch virtualenvs an operator or a tool may leave in the checkout. Without
# this a 23 MB stray venv was copied into the build context of every image.
**/.wvenv/
**/*.venv/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# --- node / frontend build artefacts (rebuilt inside the image) ---
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
backend/frontend_dist/

# --- local data: never bake samples or databases into an image ---
**/*.db
**/*.sqlite3
**/sandbox.db
**/smoke*.db
**/quarantine/
**/*-quarantine/
**/sample_corpus/

# --- env / secrets ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# --- runtime reports ---
/reports/
**/*.report.pdf

# --- editors / OS ---
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db

# --- docs and infra not needed at runtime ---
docs/
*.md
!README.md
